  "context": {
    "explanation_en": "Advanced reporting verbs carry precise meaning beyond 'said': 'suggest that' (propose), 'insist that' (state firmly), 'deny' (reject a claim, + -ing), 'admit' (confess, + -ing): 'He denied taking the money.' 'She admitted making a mistake.'",
    "explanation_ko": "고급 보고 동사는 'said'보다 정확한 의미를 전달합니다: 'suggest that'(제안하다), 'insist that'(강하게 주장하다), 'deny'(주장을 부인하다, + -ing), 'admit'(인정하다, + -ing): 'He denied taking the money.' 'She admitted making a mistake.'",
    "key_expressions": [
      {
        "en": "She insisted that she was right.",
        "ko": "그녀는 자신이 옳다고 강하게 주장했어요."
      },
      {
        "en": "He denied breaking the vase.",
        "ko": "그는 꽃병을 깬 것을 부인했어요."
      },
      {
        "en": "They admitted making a mistake.",
        "ko": "그들은 실수를 인정했어요."
      }
    ]
  },
